<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classTelemetry" kindref="compound">Telemetry</ref> class is used for launching the telemetry runner in its own process. The common use-case for this functionality is when running HDTN in distributed mode. <ref refid="classTelemetry" kindref="compound">Telemetry</ref> provides a blocking Run method, which creates and initializes a <ref refid="classTelemetryRunner" kindref="compound">TelemetryRunner</ref> object with any passed-in command line arguments. </para>
</sect1>
